    {
      "source": "Create a new AnnotationClassFilter for the given annotation type.",
      "translation": "为给定的注解类型创建一个新的 AnnotationClassFilter。",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "If this method returns <code>false</code> or if <a href=\"../../MethodMatcher.html#isRuntime()\"><code>MethodMatcher.isRuntime()</code></a>\nreturns <code>false</code>, no runtime check (i.e. no\n<a href=\"../../MethodMatcher.html#matches(java.lang.reflect.Method,java.lang.Class,java.lang.Object...)\"><code>MethodMatcher.matches(Method, Class, Object[])</code></a> call) will be made.",
      "translation": "如果此方法返回 `<code>false</code>` 或 <a href=\"../../MethodMatcher.html#isRuntime()\"><code>MethodMatcher.isRuntime()</code></a> 返回 `<code>false</code>`，则不会进行运行时检查（即不会调用 <a href=\"../../MethodMatcher.html#matches(java.lang.reflect.Method,java.lang.Class,java.lang.Object...)\"><code>MethodMatcher.matches(Method, Class, Object[])</code></a>）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"../../MethodMatcher.html#matches(java.lang.reflect.Method,java.lang.Class)\">MethodMatcher</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"../../MethodMatcher.html#matches(java.lang.reflect.Method,java.lang.Class)\">MethodMatcher</a></code></span>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Simple <a href=\"../../MethodMatcher.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.aop\"><code>MethodMatcher</code></a> that looks for\na specific annotation being present on a method (checking both the method on the\ninvoked interface, if any, and the corresponding method on the target class).",
      "translation": "简单的 <a href=\"../../MethodMatcher.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.aop\"><code>MethodMatcher</code></a>，用于查找方法上是否存在特定注解（同时检查被调用接口上的方法（如果有）以及目标类上的对应方法）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>checkInherited</code> - whether to also check the superclasses and\ninterfaces as well as meta-annotations for the annotation type\n(i.e. whether to use <a href=\"../../../core/annotation/AnnotatedElementUtils.html#hasAnnotation(java.lang.reflect.AnnotatedElement,java.lang.Class)\"><code>AnnotatedElementUtils.hasAnnotation(AnnotatedElement, Class)</code></a>\nsemantics instead of standard Java <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/AccessibleObject.html#isAnnotationPresent(java.lang.Class)\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>AccessibleObject.isAnnotationPresent(Class)</code></a>)",
      "translation": "<code>checkInherited</code> - 是否还要检查父类和接口以及该注解类型的元注解（即，是使用 <a href=\"../../../core/annotation/AnnotatedElementUtils.html#hasAnnotation(java.lang.reflect.AnnotatedElement,java.lang.Class)\"><code>AnnotatedElementUtils.hasAnnotation(AnnotatedElement, Class)</code></a> 语义，而不是标准的 Java <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/AccessibleObject.html#isAnnotationPresent(java.lang.Class)\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>AccessibleObject.isAnnotationPresent(Class)</code></a>)。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>annotationType</code> - the annotation type to look for",
      "translation": "<code>annotationType</code> - 要查找的注解类型",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
